  "body": "## What changed\n\nCheck operation names in the CLI refusal line.\nEnable INFO logging in the child CLI to keep the regression test deterministic.\nRecord the decision in `docs/decisions/3105-default-machine-diagnostic.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nPR #3092 added a check that rejects `Face1` anywhere in stderr.\nGeneration logs correctly name `Face1` before the post refuses `Face2`.\nThe refusal already names only `Setup2` and `Face2`.\n\n## Tests\n\nPin: `a_missing_default_machine_file_refuses_the_post_per_operation`.\nThe pin failed with INFO logging before the assertion fix.\nThe pin passed after the fix.\nMutation: restore the upstream test file; the pin fails at the `Face1` assertion.\nRestore the fixed test file; the pin passes.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all nine tests in `default_machine_missing`.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The diff contains no `.nc` or `.cl` changes.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full batch and release gates did not run.\nNo manual GUI checks ran.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changes either file.\n\nEffort: low\n\nChangelog: Fix a false failure in the default-machine refusal test when generation logs name a mounted operation.\n\nFixes #3105\n",
